                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm gonna refund this. I played it solo, as is intended I guess, but there is no way to beat the level. The game hints that you can upgrade bots in the \"Library,\" yet I only can look at the stats of the different bots there. I like the idea and concept, but it feels like this was never playtested with one player.\n\nOther things I noted:\n- I had to figure out where the consumable upgrades are; they are near your PC on the left.\n- Upgrades do not feel game-changing or worth it.\n- Enemy units can be slow or get stuck, putting you in an endless combat lockdown which prevents certain actions.\n\nThus can't recommend.",
